<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Flashing Grip</h1>
<p>Sphere: Mind Sphere
Class: Healer (guild level 115, up to 80%)
Mana: 44
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast flashing grip &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast flashing grip</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>The mightiest of the colour spells: a grip of flashing colours closes on 
the target's mind. The better your divine power and your skill in the 
spell, the more it hurts. It does best against clothes, less the heavier 
the armour, and least against plate. A shield takes some of it, but can't 
stop it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It can be cast while 
fighting. It is also found on staffs, wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Flash</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Colourbeam</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Colourspray</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Mind Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>